{
  "$comment": [
    "Single source of truth for vendor SDK pinning. Consumed by:",
    "  - build/VendorPinsGenerator - emits pwiz/src/Vendor/Common/VendorSdkPins.generated.cs",
    "    (the runtime resolver's pin table)",
    "  - installer/build.ps1 - flattens 'prefixes' into the staging filter that strips",
    "    vendor DLLs out of the MSI",
    "Paths are repo-relative. Most archives live under pwiz_aux/msrc/utility/; Thermo on the",
    "pwiz-sharp side has its own newer .NET-8-compatible copy under pwiz-sharp/vendor-archives/."
  ],
  "repo": "ProteoWizard/pwiz",
  "vendors": [
    {
      "name": "Thermo",
      "path": "pwiz-sharp/vendor-archives/vendor_api_Thermo.7z",
      "prefixes": [ "ThermoFisher.", "OpenMcdf" ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Bruker",
      "path": "pwiz_aux/msrc/utility/vendor_api_Bruker.7z",
      "prefixes": [
        "Bruker.", "BaseDataAccess", "BDal.", "CompassXtractMS", "EDAL", "Interop.EDAL",
        "ProtocolBuffers", "BaseError", "BaseCommon", "Compass", "BaseTof", "timsdata",
        "baf2sql", "mcd_lib"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Bruker-linux",
      "$comment": [
        "Bruker is the one vendor whose Windows and Linux native libraries live in separate",
        "archives (see Bruker.csproj: one archive per OS so nobody downloads binaries for a",
        "platform they are not building for). Both answer to the same prefixes, so 'os' narrows",
        "the match - without it Linux would fetch the 10.7 MB Windows archive and still not find",
        "libtimsdata.so. Waters needs no equivalent: its single archive carries both platforms."
      ],
      "os": "linux",
      "path": "pwiz_aux/msrc/utility/vendor_api_Bruker_linux.7z",
      "prefixes": [ "timsdata", "baf2sql" ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Waters",
      "path": "pwiz-sharp/vendor-archives/vendor_api_Waters.7z",
      "prefixes": [ "MassLynxRaw", "libMassLynxRaw", "MassLynx" ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Agilent",
      "path": "pwiz_aux/msrc/utility/vendor_api_Agilent.7z",
      "prefixes": [
        "Agilent.", "BaseDataAccess", "MIDAC.", "Mhdac.", "MassHunter.", "MassSpecDataReader",
        "agtsampleinforw"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "ABI",
      "path": "pwiz_aux/msrc/utility/vendor_api_ABI.7z",
      "prefixes": [
        "Clearcore2.", "Sciex.", "SCIEX.", "SciexToolKit", "Interop.", "OFX.Core.",
        "ZipUtility", "protobuf-net"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Shimadzu",
      "path": "pwiz_aux/msrc/utility/vendor_api_Shimadzu.7z",
      "prefixes": [
        "Shimadzu.", "QTFL", "GCMS", "GCMSProto", "QTFLProto", "DataReader", "IDQuantLSS",
        "PeakIDEA", "PeakItgLSS", "MassLibrarySearch", "MassCalcWrap", "MassStandardSpectrum",
        "DualProbeInterface", "IoModule", "LSSMng", "CompressedTLM", "CRHAKEI", "CPCNLSS",
        "CLFIO", "LibDB", "MSMSDB"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Mobilion",
      "path": "pwiz_aux/msrc/utility/vendor_api_Mobilion.7z",
      "prefixes": [ "Mobilion.", "MBISDK", "MBI_SDK", "MobilionShim" ]
    }
  ]
}
